# Game car 1, second sheet. PDF page 12, block D.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip E2 7432
chip E4 7404
chip C4 74112
chip C3 7420
chip C1 74193
chip B1 74192   # preset 1: pin 15 alone on D999, which crosses the ground bus of 1/10/9 without a dot (fixed 2026-11-15, DR-1A 10W agrees)
chip D3 7432
chip E3 7420
chip D2 74193
chip C2 74193   # preset 1: pin 15 alone on D999; 1/10/9 on the ground bus (fixed 2026-11-15, DR-1A 10U agrees)
prom B2 82S129 91
chip B4 7404
chip Q3 7427
chip R4 7411
# Fixed 2026-11-05: pin 2 meets the inverter output at A5.12, not its input. Death Race B/D agree.
chip B3 7410
chip B5 7421
chip B6 7411
chip A7 7432
chip B7 7421
chip A6 74112
chip A5 74112
chip E9 7408
chip A4 74112
chip D4 7486

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net DEGA E2.3 E4.9 C3.13
net 5TCBG E2.1 E2.5
net 1CCT3 E2.2
net DEGB E2.6 C4.2 C4.3 C3.4 C3.12
net 5CECC E2.4
net 5DEGA E4.8 C3.5
net 2KQ07 C4.1 C4.13 A6.1 A6.13 A5.1
net D999 C4.4 C4.15 C1.10 C1.9 B1.15 C2.15 A6.4 A6.15 A6.10 A6.14 A5.10 A4.4 A4.15 A4.10 A4.14 BOARD
net DEC1 C4.5 C3.9
net 5DEC1 C4.6 C3.1
net 6DEQD C3.6 C1.4
net 1KQ07 C3.2 C3.10 E3.2 E3.12
net 6DEQU C3.8 C1.5
net 5CPRS C1.11 B1.11 D2.11 C2.11
net GND C1.14 C1.15 C1.1 B1.14 B1.1 B1.10 B1.9 D2.14 D2.15 D2.1 D2.10 D2.9 C2.14 C2.1 C2.10 C2.9
net NC C1.3 B1.13 B1.12 C2.13 C2.12 A5.6 A5.7 A4.7
net DEC3 C1.2 D4.2
net DEC4 C1.6 Q3.10 D4.1
net DEC5 C1.7 B2.4
net 6DECD C1.13 B1.4
net 6DECU C1.12 B1.5
net DEC6 B1.3 B2.3
net DEC7 B1.2 B2.2
net DEC8 B1.6 D3.13
net DEC9 B1.7 D3.12
